abstract: >-
  Publication candidate for one bounded, position-only Metriplane evaluation
  of normalized state derived from a pinned ManiSkill PickCube-v1
  demonstration episode. The proposed immutable tag is
  maniskill-pickcube-proof-v1 and is pending merge, explicit owner approval,
  and final verification. MIT applies to independently authored proof
  documentation and software; Apache-2.0 attribution and modified-data notice
  apply to the derived fixture-data boundary described in NOTICE.md. The proof
  is owner generated, not an independent reproduction or ManiSkill
  endorsement.
